                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='21200' id='30' type-v2='text' w='18538' x='80847' y='66500'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run>Restaurant Brands are split and aggregated into 3  even buckets based on their order performance.

1 = Top 10% Restaurants 
2-5 = 20-50% Restaurants
6-10 = Bottom 50% Restaurants

If there are less then 3 buckets populated it means that it&apos;s too little data for that Brand to distribute fairly, so less buckets are used.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
